# Managed by coordinator.yml (ADR 0006). Reach it through an SSH tunnel:
# ssh -L 3000:127.0.0.1:3000 <coordinator>
[Unit]
Description=Grafana for DARZ
After=network-online.target darz-prometheus.service

[Service]
User=darz-monitor
Group=darz-monitor
Environment=GF_SERVER_HTTP_ADDR=127.0.0.1
Environment=GF_SERVER_HTTP_PORT=3000
Environment=GF_PATHS_DATA=/var/lib/darz-monitor/grafana
Environment=GF_PATHS_LOGS=/var/lib/darz-monitor/grafana/log
Environment=GF_PATHS_PLUGINS=/var/lib/darz-monitor/grafana/plugins
Environment=GF_PATHS_PROVISIONING=/etc/darz/grafana/provisioning
Environment=GF_ANALYTICS_REPORTING_ENABLED=false
Environment=GF_ANALYTICS_CHECK_FOR_UPDATES=false
Environment=GF_ANALYTICS_CHECK_FOR_PLUGIN_UPDATES=false
Environment=GF_NEWS_NEWS_FEED_ENABLED=false
ExecStart=/usr/local/lib/darz/grafana-{{ darz_versions.GRAFANA }}/bin/grafana server \
  --homepath /usr/local/lib/darz/grafana-{{ darz_versions.GRAFANA }}
Restart=always
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
